---
description: Run one phase of the design-system migration (triage, foundations, kit, parity, component <key>, cleanup, patterns). Invoke by @-mentioning this rule.
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `ds.config.json` at the repo root. Ask which phase to run if not stated, then load exactly one of:

- triage → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/triage.md
- foundations → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/foundations.md
- kit → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/kit.md
- parity → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/parity.md
- component <key> → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/component.md, with @ds-ai-ready/core/rules.md
- cleanup → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/cleanup.md
- patterns → @ds-ai-ready/core/phases/patterns.md

Execute it end to end, stopping at every "Done when" to verify. Never start a component whose kit page is not at the ready marker.
